# Input

```md
- a paragraph that is long enough to need wrapping when the line width is forty columns

  a second paragraph that is long enough to need wrapping when the line width is forty columns
  1. nested item that is long enough to need wrapping at forty columns

     nested paragraph that is long enough to need wrapping at forty columns

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "formatter": {
      "indentWidth": 8,
      "proseWrap": "always",
      "lineWidth": 40
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```md
- a paragraph that is long enough to
  need wrapping when the line width is
  forty columns

     a second paragraph that is long
     enough to need wrapping when the
     line width is forty columns
     1. nested item that is long enough
        to need wrapping at forty
        columns

           nested paragraph that is long
           enough to need wrapping at
           forty columns

```
